<title>USA: Top gains/losses in Dow Industrial history.</title>
<headline>Top gains/losses in Dow Industrial history.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average's 135.26 point gain to 6587.16 on Tuesday stands as its second largest gain in point terms.</p>
